    "basis": "the body threw and transaction.rollback() was called",
    "contract": "Django documents manual transaction management beside atomic(): set_autocommit(False), then commit() or rollback(), then set_autocommit(True) (docs/topics/db/transactions.txt, Controlling transactions explicitly). commit() is Django's report that it asked the database to commit.",
